  <item>
    <title>英文编织播客|穿棒针Bra凸点怎么办？Knitting Podcast 23.07</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64c44bb599e1e7669e4845eb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64c44bb599e1e7669e4845eb</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 28 Jul 2023 23:13:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期是小禾的英文编织播客Seedling Stitch Knitting Podcast的七月特辑，分享了关于棒针编织Bra、婚纱钩织和近期获得的毛线和编织书等内容。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本集的英文原版可以看我的YouTube频道：</span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/SeedlingStitch" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/c/SeedlingStitch"><span>Athena Liu//Seedling Stitch</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>相同内容的中文视频版可以看我的Bilibili（或同名小红书）：</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/3218172" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/3218172"><span>小禾唠编织</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>Hello and welcome to the July 2023 episode of the Seedling Stitch Knitting Podcast! I knitted 2 bra / bralettes and shared some thoughts on comfortable bras and body insecurity. I started crocheting my wedding dress and have made significant progress. Many new acquisitions appear in this episode, including a new Japanese Keitodama issue, and a special possum yarn from New Zealand! Hope you enjoy this episode!</span></p><span></span><p><span>{ TIMESTAMPS }</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MLgyN2QI294&amp;t=0s" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MLgyN2QI294&amp;t=0s"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a></span></a><span> Intro &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>WHAT I'M WEARING</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MLgyN2QI294&amp;t=150s" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MLgyN2QI294&amp;t=150s"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a></span></a><span> Vine Top &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>FOs</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MLgyN2QI294&amp;t=590s" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MLgyN2QI294&amp;t=590s"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="590">09:50</a></span></a><span> Vine Bralette</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MLgyN2QI294&amp;t=842s" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MLgyN2QI294&amp;t=842s"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="842">14:02</a></span></a><span> The Basic Bra &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>WIP</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MLgyN2QI294&amp;t=1426s" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MLgyN2QI294&amp;t=1426s"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1426">23:46</a></span></a><span> Wedding Dress &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>ACQUISITIONS</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MLgyN2QI294&amp;t=1986s" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MLgyN2QI294&amp;t=1986s"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1986">33:06</a></span></a><span> Keitodama Winter 2022</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MLgyN2QI294&amp;t=2368s" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MLgyN2QI294&amp;t=2368s"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2368">39:28</a></span></a><span> Sandnes Garn Tema 74</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MLgyN2QI294&amp;t=2450s" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MLgyN2QI294&amp;t=2450s"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2450">40:50</a></span></a><span> Van Gogh Opal Socks Yarn</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MLgyN2QI294&amp;t=2682s" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MLgyN2QI294&amp;t=2682s"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2682">44:42</a></span></a><span> Possum Yarn from NZ &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>CHATS</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MLgyN2QI294&amp;t=3058s" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MLgyN2QI294&amp;t=3058s"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3058">50:58</a></span></a><span> Audiobook Recommendations</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MLgyN2QI294&amp;t=3449s" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MLgyN2QI294&amp;t=3449s"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3449">57:29</a></span></a><span> Outro</span></p><span></span><p><span>Music: Arabesque 2 - Claude Debussy, played by me</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播/剪辑/弹琴】小禾</span></p><span></span><p><span>【其他平台】</span></p><span></span><p><span>b站频道：</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/3218172" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/3218172"><span>小禾唠编织</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>YouTube：</span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/c/SeedlingStitch" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/c/SeedlingStitch"><span>Athena Liu//Seedling Stitch</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>爱发电：</span><a href="https://afdian.net/a/seedlingstitch" data-url="https://afdian.net/a/seedlingstitch"><span>小禾唠编织</span></a><span>（打赏赞助+购买图解+加入唠嗑群）</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ko-Fi：</span><a href="https://ko-fi.com/seedlingstitch" data-url="https://ko-fi.com/seedlingstitch"><span>SeedlingStitch</span></a><span> (海外赞助+购买图解+加入唠嗑群）</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书/ins：sd_athena</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ravelry: </span><a href="https://www.ravelry.com/designers/athena-liu" data-url="https://www.ravelry.com/designers/athena-liu"><span>Athena Liu</span></a></p>]]></description>
