  <item>
    <title>六月编织合集：夏季衣服 | 十刻竹雨测评 | 领到博士毕业证啦！【小禾唠编织2023.06】</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64a5b0d2b21ecc647d736e22</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64a5b0d2b21ecc647d736e22</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 05 Jul 2023 18:05:04 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>六月里终于把手头的各项WIP （work in progress，正在进行中的作品）都变成FO（finished object，完成的作品）啦！这期就跟大家盘点一下这些作品和制作过程中的心得。开新的WIP中尝试了十刻的竹雨和云端，也在视频中对这两款线做了测评。最后跟大家分享一下刚领到的博士毕业证，呼呼，终于跟我的学术生涯说拜拜啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>可以在我的Bilibili频道看本期的视频版：</span><a href="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/63c6ec4cca053e547abd9413/create/BV1RP411e7pg" data-url="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/63c6ec4cca053e547abd9413/create/BV1RP411e7pg"><span>小禾唠编织2023.06</span></a></p><span></span><h2><span>Intro <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a></span></h2><span></span><h2><span>编织&amp;缝纫成品 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="39">00:39</a></span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Kuutar Top - Sari Nordlund</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>藤蔓背心-超短款</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>松柏毛衣-袖子改动</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Jules Genser朱莉毛衣 - Sandnes Garn 2202</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>编织进展 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="937">15:37</a></span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>藤蔓小吊带/文胸 &amp; 十刻竹雨测评</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>The Basic Bra - NakedKnit 十刻云端（真丝羊绒拉毛纱）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h1><span>收获 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1159">19:19</a></span></h1><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>拿到博士毕业证啦</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>弹琴：德彪西《月光》<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2189">36:29</a></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【主播/剪辑/弹琴】小禾</span></p><span></span><p><span>【其他平台】</span></p><span></span><p><span>b站频道：</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/3218172" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/3218172"><span>小禾唠编织</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>爱发电：</span><a href="https://afdian.net/a/seedlingstitch" data-url="https://afdian.net/a/seedlingstitch"><span>小禾唠编织</span></a><span>（打赏赞助+购买图解+加入唠嗑群）</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ko-Fi：</span><a href="https://ko-fi.com/seedlingstitch" data-url="https://ko-fi.com/seedlingstitch"><span>SeedlingStitch</span></a><span> (海外赞助+购买图解+加入唠嗑群）</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书/ins：sd_athena</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ravelry: </span><a href="https://www.ravelry.com/designers/athena-liu" data-url="https://www.ravelry.com/designers/athena-liu"><span>Athena Liu</span></a></p>]]></description>
