  <item>
    <title>全英文唠编织 | 五月钩针、棒针、缝纫作品分享；毛线球杂志介绍</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/649c7a55ba16d4cb984504d1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">649c7a55ba16d4cb984504d1</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 28 Jun 2023 18:22:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期补发一下6月1日录制的英文编织播客视频，搬运自我的英文YouTube频道“Seedling Stitch”。英文视频主要是面向外文织友圈制作的，有些内容咱们国内织友可能早就知道啦，比如大名鼎鼎的《毛线球》杂志！这期视频里讲的几个编织、缝纫作品在我之前的中文节目中也跟大家唠过，不过如果你想听听用英文怎么唠这些手作作品--尤其是想了解一些英文术语的话，也欢迎你看一下这期节目~</span></p><span></span><p><span>也可以去我的b站频道看视频+字幕：</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/3218172" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/3218172"><span>小禾唠编织Bilibili</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>Hello and welcome to my *knitting* podcast, but there are crocheting and sewing in this episode, too! I crocheted a straw hat and the cute phone pouch, and sewed my first skirt. I'm happy with all these FOs! However, I'm experiencing a major setback in my new knitting design, but I rescued it with my newly acquired sewing skills. I was gifted 3 issues of Keitodama magazines and I'm so excited to share them with you. Hope you enjoy this episode. Happy crafting!</span></p><span></span><p><span>{ TIMESTAMPS }</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> Intro</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="119">01:59</a> Provence Top</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="188">03:08</a> Crocheted Straw Hat</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1148">19:08</a> Raffia Phone Bag</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1294">21:34</a> Skirt Sewing</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1627">27:07</a> Vine Tank Top</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2247">37:27</a> Kuutar Top</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2424">40:24</a> Jules Genser</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2530">42:10</a> Shorts Sewing</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2736">45:36</a> Japanese Knitting Magazines (Keitodama)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3839">01:03:59</a> Knitting in Chinese TV Shows</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4130">01:08:50</a> Outro</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4226">01:10:26</a> Piano - Clair de Lune</span></p><span></span><p><span>Remember to SUBSCRIBE &amp; TURN ON NOTIFICATIONS if you'd like to know immediately when there's a new video up!Thank you so much for watching!</span></p><span></span><p><span>💚 Athena{ SOCIAL }&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>- Instagram: sd_athena </span><a href="https://www.instagram.com/sd_athena/" data-url="https://www.instagram.com/sd_athena/"><span>www.instagram.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>- Ravelry (patterns, projects): athenaliu </span><a href="https://www.ravelry.com/designers/athena-liu" data-url="https://www.ravelry.com/designers/athena-liu"><span>www.ravelry.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>- Ko-fi (donation, patterns &amp; translation help): </span><a href="https://ko-fi.com/seedlingstitch" data-url="https://ko-fi.com/seedlingstitch"><span>ko-fi.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>- Bilibili (my Chinese channel): 小禾唠编织 </span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/3218172" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/3218172"><span>space.bilibili.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>- My Chinese YouTube channel: &nbsp;@seedlingstitch_ch &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>- My LYS: Wet Coast Wools &nbsp;</span><a href="https://wetcoastwools.com/" data-url="https://wetcoastwools.com/"><span>wetcoastwools.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>Music: Clair de Lune - Claude Debussy, played by me</span></p>]]></description>
