  <item>
    <title>Ep21.新款亚麻编织背心设计&quot;藤蔓&quot; &amp; 毛衣手术</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64933bdaa5b2b405c6706591</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64933bdaa5b2b405c6706591</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 21 Jun 2023 18:05:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期主要唠一唠我最新设计的这款 VineTop 藤蔓背心。这款的编织过程中还不得不使用了“毛衣手术”的技巧，来把织错了的上半部分截掉，把新织的上半部分移花接木到原来的下半部分。这一招也适用于给毛衣在中间加长，分享给大家~视频中还分享了其它几款夏季编织作品的进程，欢迎来跟我唠编织~</span></p><span></span><p><span>可以在我的Bilibili频道看本期的视频版：</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV19M4y1n7Bf/" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV19M4y1n7Bf/"><span>小禾唠编织(21)</span></a></p><span></span><h2><span>节目笔记</span></h2><span></span><p><span>藤蔓背心&amp;毛衣手术 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>藤蔓短袖 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="693">11:33</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>Kuutar Top月神吊带&amp;如何给毛衣清洗定型 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="721">12:01</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播/剪辑/弹琴】小禾</span></p><span></span><p><span>【其他平台】</span></p><span></span><p><span>b站频道：</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/3218172" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/3218172"><span>小禾唠编织</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>爱发电：</span><a href="https://afdian.net/a/seedlingstitch" data-url="https://afdian.net/a/seedlingstitch"><span>小禾唠编织</span></a><span>（打赏赞助+购买图解+加入唠嗑群）</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ko-Fi：</span><a href="https://ko-fi.com/seedlingstitch" data-url="https://ko-fi.com/seedlingstitch"><span>SeedlingStitch</span></a><span> (海外赞助+购买图解+加入唠嗑群）</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书/ins：sd_athena</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ravelry: </span><a href="https://www.ravelry.com/designers/athena-liu" data-url="https://www.ravelry.com/designers/athena-liu"><span>Athena Liu</span></a></p>]]></description>
