  <item>
    <title>Ep20.编织博主唠《漫长的季节》：王响红毛衣、美素织毛线折射出的东北编织文化【小禾唠编织】</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6489fea8e16019bcbcba67cc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6489fea8e16019bcbcba67cc</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 14 Jun 2023 17:53:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《漫长的季节》大家看了吗？作为一个东北的编织博主，剧中的各种编织场景、毛衣织物和东北氛围都给我留下了深刻的印象。这期就跟大家唠一唠我看剧的心得，盘点一下剧中的精美毛衣。</span></p><span></span><p><span>可以在我的Bilibili频道看本期的视频版：</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1w14y1D7yc/" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1w14y1D7yc/"><span>小禾唠编织(20)</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>如果喜欢听我唠影视剧中的编织文化，可以看第5期讲日剧《初恋First Love》和第8期讲电视剧《三体》哦~</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期分为两段放送，这段唠电视剧，下周会放出后半段，唠一唠我身上穿的这件《藤蔓背心》，是我自己设计并编织的无袖上衣。敬请期待哦！</span></p><span></span><h2><span>节目笔记</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>王响的红毛衣 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="179">02:59</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>与编织有关的场景—东北人是如何织毛衣的？<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="500">08:20</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>跟美素学习如何缠毛线 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1025">17:05</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>其它好看毛衣、织物分析 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1297">21:37</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>【剧透内容】林晓杰Diana Lin老师的精彩演绎-她是我老乡！<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1777">29:37</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>氛围尤其背景音乐跟游戏《极乐迪斯科Disco Elysium》很像-Sea Power的配乐 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1343">22:23</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>关于“爹味”：熟悉又不适，但甚至有些怀旧 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2068">34:28</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>弹琴：德彪西《月光》<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2189">36:29</a></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【主播/剪辑/弹琴】小禾</span></p><span></span><p><span>【其他平台】</span></p><span></span><p><span>b站频道：</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/3218172" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/3218172"><span>小禾唠编织</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>爱发电：</span><a href="https://afdian.net/a/seedlingstitch" data-url="https://afdian.net/a/seedlingstitch"><span>小禾唠编织</span></a><span>（打赏赞助+购买图解+加入唠嗑群）</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ko-Fi：</span><a href="https://ko-fi.com/seedlingstitch" data-url="https://ko-fi.com/seedlingstitch"><span>SeedlingStitch</span></a><span> (海外赞助+购买图解+加入唠嗑群）</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书/ins：sd_athena</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ravelry: </span><a href="https://www.ravelry.com/designers/athena-liu" data-url="https://www.ravelry.com/designers/athena-liu"><span>Athena Liu</span></a></p>]]></description>
