  <item>
    <title>全英文编织播客 Ep.21 | 藤蔓短袖、棒针Bra、80年代编织杂志 | Knitting Podcast</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6480cca66752b5f9de3339b6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6480cca66752b5f9de3339b6</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 07 Jun 2023 18:29:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本周更一个上个月录的英文节目，是2023.5.9发在我油管频道“SeedlingStitch Knitting Podcast”的第21期。这期里分享的作品我在中文节目里都唠过，不过这期里有我试穿棒针内衣TheBasic Bra的片段，所以对这款的试穿效果感兴趣的姐妹可以去视频版看哦~</span></p><span></span><p><span>视频版（附机翻双语字幕）在b站观看：</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1X14y1U7gg" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1X14y1U7gg"><span>Knitting Podcast Ep.21</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>Hi knitters &amp; friends, I have so much to catch up with you in this episode! I designed a new summer T-shirt, the Vine Tee, and talked a lot about the behind-the-scene design ideas. I found the best knitted bra pattern and also won the game of yarn chicken by a mere 2g. I shared some vintage Chinese knitting books from the 1980s and some Chinese yarn that I just received. I cast on the Kuutar Top and gave you a deep analysis on how Sari adapted a pattern from the Japanese Knitting Stitch Bible into her popular designs. As usual, I played the piano for you at the end of the episode. Hope you like it!</span></p><span></span><h2><span>{ TIMESTAMPS }</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> Intro</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="147">02:27</a> Vine Tee</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="774">12:54</a> The Basic Br</span></p><span></span><p><span>a<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1273">21:13</a> Snowbell Socks</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1347">22:27</a> Jules Genser</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1477">24:37</a> Keitodama Crocheted Slipover</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1568">26:08</a> Kuutar Top</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2430">40:30</a> Vintage Chinese Knitting Books</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3194">53:14</a> Lotus Yarn &amp; Vine Top Design</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3786">01:03:06</a> Fabric &amp; Sewing Books</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3993">01:06:33</a> Outro</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4188">01:09:48</a> Piano - Clair de Lune</span></p><span></span><p><span>Remember to SUBSCRIBE &amp; TURN ON NOTIFICATIONS if you'd like to know immediately when there's a new video up!Thank you so much for watching!</span></p><span></span><p><span>💚 Athena</span></p><span></span><p><span>弹琴：Clair de Lune - Claude Debussy</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播/剪辑/弹琴】小禾</span></p><span></span><p><span>【其他平台】</span></p><span></span><p><span>b站频道：</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/3218172" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/3218172"><span>小禾唠编织</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>爱发电：</span><a href="https://afdian.net/a/seedlingstitch" data-url="https://afdian.net/a/seedlingstitch"><span>小禾唠编织</span></a><span>（打赏赞助+购买图解+加入唠嗑群）</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ko-Fi：</span><a href="https://ko-fi.com/seedlingstitch" data-url="https://ko-fi.com/seedlingstitch"><span>SeedlingStitch</span></a><span> (海外赞助+购买图解+加入唠嗑群）</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书/ins：sd_athena</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ravelry: </span><a href="https://www.ravelry.com/designers/athena-liu" data-url="https://www.ravelry.com/designers/athena-liu"><span>Athena Liu</span></a></p>]]></description>
