  <item>
    <title>Ep19.钩针草帽freestyle！根据头围尺寸钩织一顶完美草帽【小禾唠编织】</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/647796576752b5f9dea7348d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">647796576752b5f9dea7348d</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 31 May 2023 18:47:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>夏天到了，是时候钩织一顶大大帽檐的遮阳帽了！这期节目跟大家分享了我自己设计并钩织的这顶和纸线草帽的经验和心得。我觉得钩织草帽最好不要完全照搬图解，因为根据线材、手劲儿和头围的不同，别人设计的草帽你按图钩来不一定合适。所以，推荐你尝试根据自己的头围尺寸钩织，自由地设置加针行，边试戴边钩织。同时，你也可以根据自己的爱好调整帽身和帽檐的角度。希望我这期视频里分享的方法能给你freestyle一顶自己的草帽些许灵感！</span></p><span></span><p><span>可以在我的Bilibili频道看本期的视频版：</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV13h4y1d7Ev" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV13h4y1d7Ev"><span>小禾唠编织(19)</span></a></p><span></span><h2><span>节目笔记</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>帽子展示 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="79">01:19</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>线材 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="196">03:16</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>参考书 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="373">06:13</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>帽顶 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="421">07:01</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>帽身 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="626">10:26</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>帽檐 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="871">14:31</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>片尾 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1033">17:13</a></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>弹琴：Clair de Lune - Claude Debussy</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播/剪辑/弹琴】小禾</span></p><span></span><p><span>【其他平台】</span></p><span></span><p><span>b站频道：</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/3218172" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/3218172"><span>小禾唠编织</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>爱发电：</span><a href="https://afdian.net/a/seedlingstitch" data-url="https://afdian.net/a/seedlingstitch"><span>小禾唠编织</span></a><span>（打赏赞助+购买图解+加入唠嗑群）</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ko-Fi：</span><a href="https://ko-fi.com/seedlingstitch" data-url="https://ko-fi.com/seedlingstitch"><span>SeedlingStitch</span></a><span> (海外赞助+购买图解+加入唠嗑群）</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书/ins：sd_athena</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ravelry: </span><a href="https://www.ravelry.com/designers/athena-liu" data-url="https://www.ravelry.com/designers/athena-liu"><span>Athena Liu</span></a></p>]]></description>
