    <title>Ep18b.编织博主学缝纫！做第一条裙子 + 拉菲草手机包包【小禾唠编织】</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/646e5b3f53a5e5ea14fcfca8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">646e5b3f53a5e5ea14fcfca8</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 24 May 2023 18:45:18 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本周份的编织唠嗑来啦~这次除了我拿手的棒针内容，还有缝纫和钩针！我尝试缝纫了！第一条裙子做得一波三折，在节目里也跟大家分享了我犯过的小白错误。不过成品十分满意，终于时隔多年又穿上了裙子~我还尝试用棉草线钩包包了，乐趣多多，成品也很美丽。不知道这期节目会不会鼓励你也尝试缝纫和棉草钩编呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>可以在我的Bilibili频道看本期的视频版：</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV18N411y7XT" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV18N411y7XT"><span>小禾唠编织(18b)</span></a></p><span></span><h2><span>节目笔记</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>近期手作记录</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>第一条缝纫裙子翻车记录    </span><ul><span>      </span><li><span>布料熨烫问题</span></li><span>      </span><li><span>正反面弄错</span></li><span>      </span><li><span>缝份方向弄错</span></li><span>    </span></ul><span>  </span></li><span>  </span><li><span>小包内衬</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>棉草手机包（参考图解书在xhs店铺有售）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>藤蔓背心</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Kuutar Top</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>下期预告：英文节目或翻书花样书节目。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>弹琴：Clair de Lune - Claude Debussy</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播/剪辑/弹琴】小禾</span></p><span></span><p><span>【其他平台】</span></p><span></span><p><span>b站频道：</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/3218172" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/3218172"><span>小禾唠编织</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>爱发电：</span><a href="https://afdian.net/a/seedlingstitch" data-url="https://afdian.net/a/seedlingstitch"><span>小禾唠编织</span></a><span>（打赏赞助+购买图解+加入唠嗑群）</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ko-Fi：</span><a href="https://ko-fi.com/seedlingstitch" data-url="https://ko-fi.com/seedlingstitch"><span>SeedlingStitch</span></a><span> (海外赞助+购买图解+加入唠嗑群）</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书/ins：sd_athena</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ravelry: </span><a href="https://www.ravelry.com/designers/athena-liu" data-url="https://www.ravelry.com/designers/athena-liu"><span>Athena Liu</span></a></p>]]></description>
