  <item>
    <title>Ep18a.Ravelry (R网)使用教程【小禾唠编织】</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/646d397f53a5e5ea14e43bef</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">646d397f53a5e5ea14e43bef</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 23 May 2023 22:09:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期视频来教大家使用编织界的门户网站-</span><a href="https://www.ravelry.com/" data-url="https://www.ravelry.com/"><span>Ravelry（R网）</span></a><span>。我示范并介绍了R网的主要功能，包括找图解、记录作品信息、看线材信息、使用论坛和发布自己的设计等等。R网目前有繁体中文版，而且国内也可以使用。上面有大量世界各地设计师的图解和织友们的作品集。相信R网上的信息能够为你的编织带来很多灵感！</span></p><span></span><p><span>可以在我的Bilibili频道看本期的视频版：</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV19M4y1q7mN" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV19M4y1q7mN"><span>小禾唠编织(18a)</span></a></p><span></span><h2><span>节目笔记</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>Ravelry使用教程</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>注册（可能需要梯子，后续不需要）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>切换语言</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>找图解</span></strong><span>，使用过滤器 eg. circular yoke fox; Chinese</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>查看图解、其他织友的project，了解替换线材信息</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>收藏图解，建立bundle整理 eg. Summer bundles, sock bundles</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>购买图解 eg. my designs</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>通过图解</span><strong><span>建立Project</span></strong><span>. eg. Kuutar Top</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>直接建立Project eg. Crocheted Phone Bag</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>查看线材信息</span></strong><span>：粗细、材质、适合的图解 eg. Line</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>参与论坛讨论</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>发布自己的图解</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【主播/剪辑/弹琴】小禾</span></p><span></span><p><span>【其他平台】</span></p><span></span><p><span>b站频道：</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/3218172" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/3218172"><span>小禾唠编织</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>爱发电：</span><a href="https://afdian.net/a/seedlingstitch" data-url="https://afdian.net/a/seedlingstitch"><span>小禾唠编织</span></a><span>（打赏赞助+购买图解+加入唠嗑群）</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ko-Fi：</span><a href="https://ko-fi.com/seedlingstitch" data-url="https://ko-fi.com/seedlingstitch"><span>SeedlingStitch</span></a><span> (海外赞助+购买图解+加入唠嗑群）</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书/ins：sd_athena</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ravelry: </span><a href="https://www.ravelry.com/designers/athena-liu" data-url="https://www.ravelry.com/designers/athena-liu"><span>Athena Liu</span></a></p>]]></description>
