  <item>
    <title>Ep17.夏天织什么？内衣、月神吊带 + 十刻毛线拆箱测评【小禾唠编织】</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/646523796752b5f9de64d2c5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">646523796752b5f9de64d2c5</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 17 May 2023 18:56:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>夏天到了，是不是就不能织毛衣了呀？No！使用清凉的夏季线材（棉、麻、丝等），也有很多夏季服饰可以编织哦~这期小禾就跟大家唠一唠最近织的内衣、短袖和真丝吊带吧。最近还收到了十刻手编线寄来的一箱毛线，所以节目后一半就来跟大家一边拆箱一边测评一下这些线材。祝大家夏日愉快！</span></p><span></span><p><span>可以在我的Bilibili频道看本期的视频版：</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1bh411w7ES/" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1bh411w7ES/"><span>小禾唠编织(17)</span></a></p><span></span><h2><span>节目笔记</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>近期编织记录</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>藤蔓短袖测织进行中    </span><ul><span>      </span><li><span>插播小广告：爱发电支持，群友参与测织优先</span></li><span>    </span></ul><span>  </span></li><span>  </span><li><span>松柏毛衣被回归线《质趣志》选中但又被取消</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>The Basic Bra - NakedKnit 织完只剩下2g线，超合身！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Kuutar Top - Sari Nordlund 月神吊带 开新，用KFO真丝线</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>毛线拆箱</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>十刻、萌娃娃</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>弹琴：Clair de Lune - Claude Debussy</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播/剪辑/弹琴】小禾</span></p><span></span><p><span>【其他平台】</span></p><span></span><p><span>b站频道：</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/3218172" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/3218172"><span>小禾唠编织</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>爱发电：</span><a href="https://afdian.net/a/seedlingstitch" data-url="https://afdian.net/a/seedlingstitch"><span>小禾唠编织</span></a><span>（打赏赞助+购买图解+加入唠嗑群）</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ko-Fi：</span><a href="https://ko-fi.com/seedlingstitch" data-url="https://ko-fi.com/seedlingstitch"><span>SeedlingStitch</span></a><span> (海外赞助+购买图解+加入唠嗑群）</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书/ins：sd_athena</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ravelry: </span><a href="https://www.ravelry.com/designers/athena-liu" data-url="https://www.ravelry.com/designers/athena-liu"><span>Athena Liu</span></a></p>]]></description>
