  <item>
    <title>【边织边唠】从《怒呛人生》看INFJ的黑化之路 | 白莲花度假村 | 黑暗荣耀 | 看不见的女性 | 星露谷物语</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6452a011306513184cf905ec</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6452a011306513184cf905ec</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 03 May 2023 17:55:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期尝试不剪辑地做一期边织边唠节目，跟大家盘点一下近期看过的好剧、好书、玩的游戏和听的音乐会，尤其是花了近40分钟的时间从MBTI的角度深度解析了《怒呛人生Beef》中的种种亚裔创伤。这期一共也就剪掉了两分钟的内容吧，保留了近80分钟的超长唠嗑。不知道大家喜不喜欢这样的形式呀？如果喜欢一定要告诉我，这样特省事而且我录得也很开心呢~</span></p><span></span><p><span>可以在我的Bilibili频道看本期的视频版：</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1QM4y1t7kw/" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1QM4y1t7kw/"><span>边织边唠</span></a></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>节目笔记</span></strong></h2><span></span><h2><span>Intro <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a></span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>尝试不剪辑做一期节目，不然剪得像个AI而且助长自我批判</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>唠唠最近看的影视剧、游戏，和近期编织记录</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>广告：小红书店铺有售图解、针线；藤蔓测织（招募或进行中）；爱发电支持者在爱发电买图解有折扣、加唠嗑群，群友测织优先</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>弹幕告诉我你在织些什么</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>怒呛人生Beef <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="244">04:04</a></span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>路怒引发的Asian American黑暗喜剧</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>从MBTI的角度理解：讲了两个INFJ的黑化之路</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Asian Trauma大荟萃，但又可以从Western therapy的lens来看    </span><ul><span>      </span><li><span>Western therapy doesn’t work on eastern minds? Why?</span></li><span>      </span><li><span>理论都是对的但是实际操作上充满了压抑和denail</span></li><span>      </span><li><span>unconditional love</span></li><span>      </span><li><span>代际传递的苦难教育</span></li><span>    </span></ul><span>  </span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Amy：黑暗与痛苦不被允许讨论，不断压抑导致撕裂与自毁</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Danny：以占有和控制为爱，相比于enabling更是disabling的爱</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Naomi：顺从Asian stereotype的表象掩藏着野心和扭曲</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>George：好贤惠的wife husband；阶级差距无法共情Amy的创伤</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Fumi：惯着儿子的overprotective Asian mother</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Isaac: 更像在底层摸爬滚打的黑人群体</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Paul: 更像一个在健康环境下长大的窝囊美国青年</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>其它书影音游作品</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>白莲花度假村S2和1：讽刺privileged rich white people太到位了 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2599">43:19</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>黑暗荣耀：是精致爽剧但是受不了韩剧煽情 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2747">45:47</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>大豆田永久子与三名前夫：小田切让惊喜出现 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2815">46:55</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>疾速追杀终篇：自己去电影院看的太爽了<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2928">48:48</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Invisible Women：用统计数据论证女性作为第二性在社会中被对待导致的负面结果 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3131">52:11</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>星露谷：这个种田和钓鱼系统比动森好玩 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3454">57:34</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Nils Frahm音乐会：沉静的风琴+凶猛的电音+有趣的互动 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3606">01:00:06</a></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>最近织了啥 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3937">01:05:37</a></span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Jules Genser - 挪威编织书2202（xhs店铺有货啦）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Basic bra</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>毛线球钩针背心</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>给朋友JellyCat织的毛背心和比基尼</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【主播/剪辑/弹琴】小禾</span></p><span></span><p><span>【其他平台】</span></p><span></span><p><span>b站频道：</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/3218172" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/3218172"><span>小禾唠编织</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>爱发电：</span><a href="https://afdian.net/a/seedlingstitch" data-url="https://afdian.net/a/seedlingstitch"><span>小禾唠编织</span></a><span>（打赏赞助+购买图解+加入唠嗑群）</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ko-Fi：</span><a href="https://ko-fi.com/seedlingstitch" data-url="https://ko-fi.com/seedlingstitch"><span>SeedlingStitch</span></a><span> (海外赞助+购买图解+加入唠嗑群）</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书/ins：sd_athena</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ravelry: </span><a href="https://www.ravelry.com/designers/athena-liu" data-url="https://www.ravelry.com/designers/athena-liu"><span>Athena Liu</span></a></p>]]></description>
